144
00:34:40,579 --> 00:34:45,579
You really don't want those businesses in the downtown area.

145
00:34:45,579 --> 00:34:52,579
I point out that we had a lot of problems, particularly with the one business.

146
00:34:52,579 --> 00:34:59,349
Lots of complaints from other businesses in the area.

147
00:34:59,349 --> 00:35:05,349
